// Curated 3025 chassis catalog (Succession Wars classics). Typed against
// domain/chassis.zig `[]const Chassis` at comptime.
//
// Construction facts (Stage 10 MekLab, TechManual standard IS tech):
//   walk_mp → engine rating = tonnage × walk_mp (weight from the engine
//   table); jump_mp jump jets (0.5/1/2 t by weight class); heat_sinks total
//   (10 come free with a fusion engine); armor_half_tons of standard armor.
//   Loadouts carry the signature weapons AND their ammunition tons; slot
//   keys prefix the location (hd/ct/lt/rt/la/ra/ll/rl).
// BV2 and cost values are approximate (// TUNE). Licensing: values
// re-encoded by hand, no MegaMek files copied.
